{
	"_comment": "The main rule of a paragraph style: generate_style_css() in paragraph-styles.php and its JS twin buildStyleCssBlock() in ps-utils.js (#358). Read by paragraph-styles/__tests__/style-css.test.js and tests/Unit/ParagraphStylesStyleCssTest.php, so a change to either generator fails one of them. Raw (unsanitized) properties on purpose: both generators re-validate what they read, with PHP intval()/empty()/float printing that the JS emulates (phpInt, phpFalsy, phpFloatStr). The other fixtures in this folder hold alignment, hyphenation, color, layout, size units and Based On.",
